NOTE ON SCOPE. This licence covers the code in this repository only.

It does NOT extend to the inference engines this project integrates. Several
are research/non-commercial only — see `npm run licenses` for the current
inventory, and `oss-engine-licensing` notes in the project docs. This build is
configured for academic / non-profit use; `npm run licenses:commercial-gate`
exits non-zero if a restricted engine is installed.

MIT here means "our own code is freely reusable", not "the assembled system is
free of commercial restrictions". Those are different questions.
